  "_commit": {
    "id": "d7961729328f136a9584de177544f6876cbb466a",
    "author": "dpelegri <43083225+dpelegri@users.noreply.github.com>",
    "committer": "dpelegri <43083225+dpelegri@users.noreply.github.com>",
    "message": "mgcca 0.99.8: one naming convention for the exported API\n\nThe twelve mgcca_* exports drop their underscores (mgcca_results() is now\nmgccaResults(); acronyms go uppercase, as in mgccaImportHDF5()). The three\nnames cited in published work \u2014 mgcca_load(), mgcca_audit() and\nmgcca_select_lambda() \u2014 keep working as aliases for one release cycle.\nThe legacy base-graphics plots plotInds() and plotVars() are removed in\nfavour of plotIndividuals() and plotVariables().\n",
    "time": 1794489985
  },
